-- the searches over integer claims (hypotheses hs : IHyps, goal a ≤ b) are lib/lin.cub's omega-cert
-- and find-cert, helpers of the bootstrap files, untyped, so no checked definition calls them; a
-- reading does: #show int-cert-of (omega-cert (hyps-to-lst (int-hyps hs)) (lc-to-code (igoal-l a b))
-- (lc-to-code (igoal-r a b))). The search's result as the checker's multipliers (an empty list where
-- the search refutes):
int-cert-of : Opt (Lst Word) → Mults
int-cert-of (some l) = lst-to-mults l
int-cert-of none = munil
